ng  technique by sony and it's kind of  genius i mean they have not addressed  the other two spider-man yet but they  keep letting other people hint at it  they let empire magazine hint at it they  let andrew garfield and jimmy fallon  hint at it they tweet three spider  emojis when talking about spiderman no  way home and they just let people like  me and all of us create the hype for the  movie it's kind of genius it's  frustrating as heck but it's kind of  genius because think about it who could  this really be it could be matt murdock  but from what i've been told he's only  in one scene and he's not suiting up as  a superhero and from what i've been told  i don't think it's this scene it's not  going to be doctor strange because well  we already know he's in the film that's  not really a secret and the thought of  it being another avenger i think that's  just a diversion i don't think that's  going to happen at all we already have  enough going on a whole entire sinister  six plus doctor strange and plus two  other spiderman and not to mention the  reddit user my time to shine hello who  has been accurate about previous leaks  in the past this person even went online  today and said he's talking about toby  and like i said this person has been 100  accurate to my knowledge about the leaks  that they've posted in the past so  there's no reason to doubt that this  person is accurate about it being toby  so literally everything points to this  fourth person being toby mcguire  spider-man plus who else is gonna make  tom holland and his brother's jaw drop  while watching this scene what's going  to be so iconic or more iconic than tom  holland spider-man talking with tobey  maguire spider-man like that's as iconic  as it gets and i'm just truly excited to  see this scene on screen i'm super  excited to see the other two spider-man  even though they're not confirmed  it's pretty much all but confirmed at  this point but let me know what you  think about this article